[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0010","text":"透、圆香\n要迟到的时候，请提前联系我"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0020","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0030","text":"就算是自己人\n会议也是重要的工作"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0040","text":"————那我要进入正题了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0050","text":"有工作想找你们４个人商量\n之前那个滚大球的节目，有别的项目来问你们了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0060","text":"嘿～\n是什么项目～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0070","text":"是骑马战\n正式录制，就在这周日"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0080","text":"……\n大家觉得怎么样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0090","text":"雏菜没关系～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0100","text":"嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0110","text":"我、我也……！\n虽然时间确实很紧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0120","text":"……我也没关系"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0130","text":"哈哈，是吗……！\n那这样的话，我想加一个条件"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0140","text":"这次，希望你们拿下冠军\n这样的话，我相信你们看到的东西一定会不一样"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0150","text":"……\n冠军啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0160","text":"能、能做到吗……\n冠军…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0170","text":"谁知道呢～……啊，如果要上电视的话\n得给透前辈重新涂指甲才行～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0180","text":"与其说涂，不如说不剪掉的话很危险\n下面也要组骑马吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0190","text":"……诶\n上、上面骑的人，是……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_06030000_05_0200","text":"诶、诶诶……\n我…………！？"}]
